cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this dashboard, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PNANY Dashboard: Driven by Purpose, United in Mission"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, single-page dashboard about the leadership network of the
  Philippine Nurses Association of New York (PNANY), 2026–2028. It includes a
  multilayer network visualization, a new-member simulator (Monte Carlo and
  Bayesian), an orchestral sonification, UN Sustainable Development Goal mapping,
  and nine statistical and simulation models (path model, system dynamics,
  agent-based, regression, Bayesian, Monte Carlo, resilience, crisis surge, and
  event carbon footprint), built from public, professional information.
authors:
